{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_00_007_23_5_00_007_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fdf9ebbb6ee1af9e701f876d7cdc7d346b4fc4555629068f2d4e85d374ab744d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_00_007_23_5_00_007_23:5_00_007_23:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f93b925a89a6741431d7a8a5864b571ab61d0c15030bd6986c73b44c69fffa95",
      "text": "拜年问候可是拿手绝活",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_007_23_5_00_007_23:5_00_007_23:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34e73cd896f66dd802cdba9d0abbc85b94874a2227efaa28d45e9d9882865b4c",
      "text": "迎来了新年的315 Production。\n偶像们换上崭新的心情，\n与制作人互致问候。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_007_23_5_00_007_23:5_00_007_23:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:404815de150754c22ce21bf7a33ac355a20ad9fc9429896c3ac32fb9cfe2e105",
      "text": "制作人君！\n新年快乐喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_007_23_5_00_007_23:5_00_007_23:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17844c40d0867d56a32032e91744a35b4c63f6cb4906fd77b9c2b8d2fa18281d",
      "text": "新年快乐。\n今年也请多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_007_23_5_00_007_23:5_00_007_23:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4cda3680970f2d237531c38c68eceaf74a7d46a3dec75a20e3747fb899cef646",
      "text": "新年快乐，制作人酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_007_23_5_00_007_23:5_00_007_23:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:624593d3abd2eb4f1af167e2a08c57a053f59e215509057812ac7e6547d57e88",
      "text": "这是我们选的拜年礼物，\n请收下喵♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_007_23_5_00_007_23:5_00_007_23:cmd-000060:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52371dcc99e28203705facaf97edc6808c1caa075604543efd2e141950a42cae",
      "text": "好的！非常感谢这么棒的新年礼物！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_007_23_5_00_007_23:5_00_007_23:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e851f5503f79fc5f237ad30ce187fc3707629deda59b7f4e737c969fc1edf395",
      "text": "一开工看起来就挺忙碌的呢。\n放假的时候有好好休息吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_007_23_5_00_007_23:5_00_007_23:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:154611d2f62dda7edf2735194a4bcc35c82a5c1d9290f2e5cc0502222ed90cd3",
      "text": "当然有啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_007_23_5_00_007_23:5_00_007_23:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8851960e88ae157e3cbe09502f6f940d16be5d17cbb96408758c27ee16604aa",
      "text": "这样啊，那就好。小男孩和九郎酱，\n新年都是怎么过的呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_007_23_5_00_007_23:5_00_007_23:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9400c9850c2407680ac0313fe1253e6cf9f767e4a040e83e5ee2350692cffd35",
      "text": "来了很多客人上门致以新年问候，\n和平常没什么两样的新年。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_007_23_5_00_007_23:5_00_007_23:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fc49044acb2fb1f135d50328b5692006db6f2bc12b33c7b97dc13ef1e099891",
      "text": "吾辈也是喵。客人络绎不绝，\n忙得团团转喵～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_007_23_5_00_007_23:5_00_007_23:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1597ccd7d4caf15e725c976871d5c0638b8858fa79c8c5f09d34da906640d402",
      "text": "平安无事和平常一样就是最大的福分啦。不过，今年的\n彩，希望能朝着好的方向有所蜕变呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_007_23_5_00_007_23:5_00_007_23:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a630cdfcb2f501b726d6b14a3cad79c189c316ce057b0d3720f5ce32a43fc23",
      "text": "那是自然喵！\n要做出比去年更有趣的盛举喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_00_007_23_5_00_007_23:5_00_007_23:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:171098651be61fa51b0718970017da99120ab58728132e7f4024704b9f7973f7",
      "text": "是的。今年也会继续精进。\n制作人，还请多多关照。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
